WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.875
In the previous two verses, Arjuna

2
00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:37.541
expressed his doubt

3
00:00:37.541 --> 00:00:38.875
about the restlessness of the mind

4
00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:41.541
and the difficulties of controlling it.

5
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:42.791
In response to this,

6
00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:44.166
now here Lord Krishna,

7
00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:46.333
understanding Arjuna's dilemma,

8
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:49.000
is telling him the right solution.

9
00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:55.250
In this verse,

10
00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.750
Lord Krishna understands Arjuna's dilemma,

11
00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:58.958
but along with this,

12
00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.750
he is also making him understand

13
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.291
that control of the mind is not impossible.

14
00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:06.208
Lord Krishna says: "O Arjuna,

15
00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:07.166
undoubtedly,

16
00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:10.333
being able to bring this restless mind 
under control is difficult.

17
00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:11.958
But with the help of continuous practice

18
00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:13.458
and detachment,

19
00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:16.916
it can definitely be brought under control."

20
00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:19.625
Here continuous practice means

21
00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:21.416
that the mind whenever it wanders,

22
00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:24.833
one must try to concentrate it again.

23
00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:27.458
And yes, this must be done repeatedly.

24
00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:30.125
Along with this, here detachment means

25
00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:31.250
renouncing those things

26
00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:33.000
and attachments

27
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.375
that make the mind turbulent.

28
00:01:35.375 --> 00:01:38.625
If these two things are done,
 then the mind ultimately

29
00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:40.541
will come under control.

30
00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:41.541
Understand this with the example

31
00:01:41.541 --> 00:01:43.666
of curing a disease.

32
00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:47.000
Whenever a patient goes to a doctor,

33
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.000
ordinarily

34
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.500
in treatment, two things must be followed.

35
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.625
First – the doctor tells that 
patient to take some medicines,

36
00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:59.458
some special foods, etc. to take them.

37
00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:01.958
Now the patient must practice these.

38
00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:08.666
Along with this, the doctor tells the patient to
 stay away from some things or food items.

39
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:11.583
Now the patient must stay 
away from these things,

40
00:02:11.583 --> 00:02:13.500
must maintain detachment from them.

41
00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.458
If these two things are done,

42
00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:17.458
then the disease will definitely go away.

43
00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:19.666
Similarly for yoga –

44
00:02:19.666 --> 00:02:22.333
practice of concentration, and detachment from

45
00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:23.208
things that cause turbulence.

46
00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:27.291
This will make the mind calm and stable.

47
00:02:27.291 --> 00:02:30.000
Arjuna didn't become a great warrior just like that,

48
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.708
he did hard practice,

49
00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:33.833
followed strict discipline.

50
00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:36.416
Now here too, Lord Krishna is telling him

51
00:02:36.416 --> 00:02:39.500
to stay focused on these two basic things –

52
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:43.250
practice, and the discipline of detachment.

53
00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:47.500
For whoever is advancing
 on the path of spirituality,

54
00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.500
this verse gives them

55
00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:52.375
inspiration for patience and firmness.

56
00:02:57.208 --> 00:02:59.416
The mind is restless,

57
00:02:59.416 --> 00:03:04.041
runs in many directions at the same time.

58
00:03:04.041 --> 00:03:06.166
And it's this mind

59
00:03:06.166 --> 00:03:11.125
that many times also 
creates obstacles in progress.

60
00:03:11.125 --> 00:03:13.250
You start walking toward some purpose,

61
00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:18.500
then it distracts from the path.

62
00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:22.208
But this very mind, becoming concentrated,

63
00:03:22.208 --> 00:03:23.416
in progress

64
00:03:23.416 --> 00:03:27.541
can also become your biggest companion.

65
00:03:27.541 --> 00:03:32.083
What's needed is only to bring it under control.

66
00:03:32.083 --> 00:03:35.416
And for this, these two things are necessary –

67
00:03:35.416 --> 00:03:39.791
first, practice, and second,

68
00:03:39.791 --> 00:03:41.708
detachment.

69
00:03:41.708 --> 00:03:43.458
Practice means

70
00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:46.000
continuing to try repeatedly.

71
00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.750
Wandering of the mind is natural,

72
00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:52.708
so don't blame yourself for this.

73
00:03:52.708 --> 00:03:56.750
Only remain aware of when the mind is wandering.

74
00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.750
And whenever it wanders, concentrate it again

75
00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.666
on your goal.

76
00:04:02.666 --> 00:04:06.208
It will wander hundreds of times,
 and hundreds of times it

77
00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:09.166
must be brought to the right path.

78
00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:09.833
Just as

79
00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:10.666
from exercise

80
00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:13.708
muscles of the body become stronger,

81
00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:16.041
similarly, from continuous practice,

82
00:04:16.041 --> 00:04:19.916
concentration of the mind also becomes firm.

83
00:04:19.916 --> 00:04:22.791
Second important thing –

84
00:04:22.791 --> 00:04:24.708
detachment.

85
00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:27.833
Meaning creating distance from those things

86
00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:30.958
that distract your mind.

87
00:04:30.958 --> 00:04:32.250
And yes,

88
00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.791
don't view this only from the
 perspective of renunciation.

89
00:04:35.791 --> 00:04:38.708
View it from the perspective of right choice.

90
00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:40.375
For example,

91
00:04:40.375 --> 00:04:43.083
if you have to pass an exam,

92
00:04:43.083 --> 00:04:47.500
then study must be chosen and
 in some entertaining program

93
00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:51.500
you must stay away from wasting time.

94
00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.916
Here, it's not renunciation,

95
00:04:53.916 --> 00:04:56.416
it's selection of the right option.

96
00:04:56.416 --> 00:04:59.916
And all this is interconnected.

97
00:04:59.916 --> 00:05:03.000
Practice of keeping the mind concentrated

98
00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.833
will help you in staying away from wrong things

99
00:05:05.833 --> 00:05:09.833
and right things in selecting.

100
00:05:09.833 --> 00:05:11.333
Understand it like this –

101
00:05:11.333 --> 00:05:13.916
the mind is a child.

102
00:05:13.916 --> 00:05:16.166
Instead of scolding it when it wanders,

103
00:05:16.166 --> 00:05:19.500
repeatedly bring it to the right path.

104
00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:23.041
Choose good habits and
 stay away from bad habits.

105
00:05:23.041 --> 00:05:24.958
Choose good habits and stay away from bad habits.

106
00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:27.833
This process will take time,

107
00:05:27.833 --> 00:05:31.333
but will definitely succeed.

108
00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:33.750
Just give it a try once.

109
00:05:38.625 --> 00:05:41.166
For Arjuna at this moment, the mind

110
00:05:41.166 --> 00:05:44.833
control over seems very difficult.

111
00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:46.791
And this is his truth

112
00:05:46.791 --> 00:05:50.250
that he is expressing before me.

113
00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:54.583
Now my responsibility is
 that I give him guidance.

114
00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:56.000
And for this, it's first

115
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.291
essential

116
00:05:57.291 --> 00:06:00.083
that I understand Arjuna's mental state.

117
00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:03.166
After that, showing him the right path

118
00:06:03.166 --> 00:06:05.125
is my second responsibility.

119
00:06:05.125 --> 00:06:09.541
But many times, society or family elders,

120
00:06:09.541 --> 00:06:12.958
instead of showing sensitivity
 in times of difficulty,

121
00:06:12.958 --> 00:06:16.833
start directly with criticism.

122
00:06:16.833 --> 00:06:19.916
For example, they'll taunt,

123
00:06:19.916 --> 00:06:26.583
"Hey! You got scared from such
 a small problem?" Or will mock,

124
00:06:26.583 --> 00:06:30.625
"You don't know such an easy task?"

125
00:06:30.625 --> 00:06:33.500
Those people forget this – that criticism

126
00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.375
only breaks morale.

127
00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:37.916
Whereas of guidance

128
00:06:37.916 --> 00:06:40.708
the first step should be

129
00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:43.500
increasing someone's morale.

130
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.958
For this it's necessary that in times of difficulty,

131
00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:51.458
conversation is started with
 empathy or goodwill.

132
00:06:51.458 --> 00:06:53.875
I too first accepted Arjuna's difficulty

133
00:06:53.875 --> 00:06:58.333
by saying – yes! Undoubtedly,

134
00:06:58.333 --> 00:07:02.166
gaining control over the mind is difficult.

135
00:07:02.166 --> 00:07:03.833
This very perspective you must adopt

136
00:07:03.833 --> 00:07:06.625
with every person who comes to you

137
00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:09.208
asking for help in some problem –

138
00:07:09.208 --> 00:07:10.708
asking for help.

139
00:07:10.708 --> 00:07:12.708
whether it's your child,

140
00:07:12.708 --> 00:07:15.458
some family member, or a friend.

141
00:07:15.458 --> 00:07:20.250
First understand their dilemma and sorrow.

142
00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.750
Never break their morale.

143
00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.333
When you someone's matter

144
00:07:25.333 --> 00:07:27.916
accept with sensitivity,

145
00:07:27.916 --> 00:07:32.958
they get in the struggle hour
 a sense of someone's company.

146
00:07:32.958 --> 00:07:37.250
They feel they are not alone.

147
00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:42.375
But this is only the first step of guidance.

148
00:07:42.375 --> 00:07:44.666
The second step is that now

149
00:07:44.666 --> 00:07:46.791
they should be given practical solution

150
00:07:46.791 --> 00:07:48.583
or advice.

151
00:07:48.583 --> 00:07:51.500
Just as I told Arjuna the way

152
00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.541
to control the mind through practice

153
00:07:53.541 --> 00:07:57.208
and detachment. So just,

154
00:07:57.208 --> 00:07:59.166
for someone's true help, 

155
00:07:59.166 --> 00:08:01.333
first sensitivity,

156
00:08:01.333 --> 00:08:02.541
and after that

157
00:08:02.541 --> 00:08:07.041
practical solution. Always remember this.

158
00:08:07.041 --> 00:08:07.833
By doing this,

159
00:08:07.833 --> 00:08:11.333
you'll strengthen their morale for this – that yes!

160
00:08:11.333 --> 00:08:15.625
Their problem is definitely difficult, but

161
00:08:15.625 --> 00:08:19.000
the way to solve it is also possible.

162
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.875
Not criticism!

163
00:08:20.875 --> 00:08:25.791
Sensitivity and solution. This is real help.

164
00:08:30.625 --> 00:08:33.666
In professional life, many times it happens

165
00:08:33.666 --> 00:08:35.166
that some senior officials

166
00:08:35.166 --> 00:08:38.625
are known only for their criticism.

167
00:08:38.625 --> 00:08:41.958
If anyone goes to them for help,

168
00:08:41.958 --> 00:08:45.083
their first reaction is this –

169
00:08:45.083 --> 00:08:46.791
"This work was so easy?

170
00:08:46.791 --> 00:08:49.916
You don't even know this much?"

171
00:08:49.916 --> 00:08:52.666
This can never be true leadership.

172
00:08:52.666 --> 00:08:54.333
Because true leadership

173
00:08:54.333 --> 00:08:58.041
increases others' morale, doesn't break it.

174
00:08:58.041 --> 00:09:00.458
For Arjuna's morale, it's essential that

175
00:09:00.458 --> 00:09:02.375
I understand his dilemma.

176
00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:05.208
express with true sensitivity

177
00:09:05.208 --> 00:09:06.208
that yes!

178
00:09:06.208 --> 00:09:09.916
Control over the mind is difficult.

179
00:09:09.916 --> 00:09:11.208
This very principle will be

180
00:09:11.208 --> 00:09:13.541
appropriate at the workplace too.

181
00:09:13.541 --> 00:09:15.916
Whenever a colleague brings some personal

182
00:09:15.916 --> 00:09:17.833
problem to you,

183
00:09:17.833 --> 00:09:19.708
or they're facing difficulty in

184
00:09:19.708 --> 00:09:21.625
some project,

185
00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:25.708
then first acknowledge their feelings, 
understand them.

186
00:09:25.708 --> 00:09:27.291
understand them.

187
00:09:27.291 --> 00:09:29.625
When you accept their struggle,

188
00:09:29.625 --> 00:09:33.000
trust toward you will increase in their mind.

189
00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:37.250
Now after this empathy, 
also show the right path,

190
00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:40.375
just as I gave Arjuna the solution of continuous practice

191
00:09:40.375 --> 00:09:43.250
and detachment.

192
00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:46.833
You too, after sensitivity, will have to give

193
00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:48.625
solutions to your colleagues,

194
00:09:48.625 --> 00:09:51.208
will have to show the right path.

195
00:09:51.208 --> 00:09:55.416
Remember these two qualities of true leadership:

196
00:09:55.416 --> 00:09:58.291
Not criticism or contempt,

197
00:09:58.291 --> 00:10:00.833
give sensitivity and inspiration.

198
00:10:00.833 --> 00:10:04.916
And then, show the right direction or solution.

199
00:10:04.916 --> 00:10:08.916
Your organization and your colleagues – both

200
00:10:08.916 --> 00:10:12.708
expect this behavior from you.
